{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-15","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2014,"subject":"chemistry","number":15,"points":2,"unitId":"electro","unitLabel":"산화·환원·전기화학","topic":"전극·전기분해·패러데이","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["electro","stoich"],"stem":"다음은 용융된 산화알루미늄(Al2O3)을 탄소 전극을 이용해 전기분해\n하여 금속 알루미늄(Al)을 얻는 반응식과 장치이다. \n2Al2O3(l)+3C(s)→4Al(l)+3CO2(g)\n이 장치를 이용해 9.00kg의 알루미늄을 얻었다. 이에 대한 설명으로\n옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? (단, 패러데이 상수\nF=9.65×104C/mol, Al의 몰질량은 27.0g/mol, C의 몰질량은 \n12.0g/mol이다.)\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 산화 반쪽 반응식은 C +2O 2−→CO2+4e−이다. \nㄴ. 탄소 전극의 총 질량은 6.00kg만큼 감소하였다.\nㄷ. 흘려 준 전체 전하량은 9.65×105 쿨롱(C)이다. ","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06","fig-07"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":1,"acceptedAnswers":[1],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":42,"height":18,"region":0,"bbox":[163.08,11.575,16.8,7.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t001"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-15/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":627,"height":87,"region":0,"bbox":[39.08,54.375,250.8,34.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-15/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":653,"height":293,"region":0,"bbox":[33.88,107.575,261.2,117.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-15/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":50,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[99.08,241.575,20.0,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-15/04.webp"},{"id":"fig